      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "End of terrace four bedroom house.\r\nBenefitting from a studio apartment to the rear.\r\nCul de sac location in a large residential development.\r\nConvenient to Tallaght Hospital, TU Tallaght and The Square shopping centre.\r\nThe area is well serviced by public transport links to include LUAS red line and multiple Dublin Bus routes.\r\nExtending to approximately 130 sq. m (1,399 sq. ft).\r\nVacant possession.\r\n\r\nThis property provides an end of terrace four bedroom house with a self contained studio apartment to the rear. The property is arranged over ground and one upper floor beneath a pitched roof. This property offers off street parking. We are informed the property extends to approximately 130 sq. m (1,399 sq. ft).\r\n\r\nVacant Possession."
